@startuml
title TheDarkOfDarkness - Dungeon Under the Shed (Planned)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

rectangle "Shed Hatch\nentry condition: player has Dark Mysterious obscure Key" as hatch
rectangle "Ominous Stairway\nfrom shed into dungeon depth" as stairway
rectangle "Dungeon Cells\ncontents: fractured meat-picked bones of wizard's victims" as cells
rectangle "Summoning Chamber\nscene: mauled wizard corpse resting on a slab\nitem: tattered destroyed grimoire in wizard's hands\nfeature: summoning portal" as chamber
rectangle "Restored Incantation\naction: use Dark Cursed wand + paper scrap + grimoire\nnote: final word unclear, player mumbles it" as incantation
rectangle "Victory / Cliffhanger\nportal closes, then drags player through\nnew scene: demonic castle with stone gargoyles\n'...did that one just move?'" as victory

hatch --> stairway : down
stairway --> cells : descend
cells --> chamber : pass through cells
chamber --> incantation : restore readable spell
incantation --> victory : recite incantation

note bottom of chamber
Dungeon access is gated from Shed Entrance and
requires "Dark Mysterious obscure Key".
Grimoire restoration needs Dark Cursed wand +
paper scrap from Vegetable Spirit.
Reciting the restored incantation closes this chapter,
but the ending launches the player into a new threat.
This flow is planned and not wired in code yet.
end note

@enduml
